  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Differentiating w.r.t. <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math> we get <math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math><br />Integrating, we have<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>4</mn> </mfrac> <mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br />As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
